{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"426ebe13de2a9b93ca479c5f1751f526944d21919dae45bfbcebc59849ebfee9","ja":"今日のお仕事は水着グラビアの撮影。\nさっそく水着に着替えた風花と可奈だったけど……","zh":"今天的工作是拍摄泳装写真。\n风花和可奈立刻换上了泳装，可是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"dd6d1d097617ac11b680b1cdd7a06e3d6a498d142f83623428175d78b4e377d0","ja":"（うぅ……やっぱり、何回やっても、\n水着のグラビア撮影は落ち着かないなぁ……）","zh":"（唔……不管拍多少次，\n泳装写真拍摄果然还是让人静不下心来啊……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"dbbe81e7b2da4be06fc01d9a63544b46de4913e96d0d27955a26d2754f3abd6c","ja":"あっ、風花さん。\nもう準備してたんですね！","zh":"啊，风花小姐。\n原来您已经准备好了啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0af78cca8d78327a874ca79737672ab85dd225205f0055a1e9fbf4a268f9bb99","ja":"うん。ちょっと緊張しちゃって。\n本番前に、気持ちを整えておこうと思って……。","zh":"嗯。有点紧张起来了。\n想在正式演出前，先把心情调整好……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3a69fb237852f7f80b006216d1558a6e6f943b9ce4d4f152811489f1061e6d95","ja":"風花さんも、ですか！？","zh":"风花小姐也是吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ec1c55d5e8fa8732d47ce1f3bf12ba5829f4655b2178e7f86af89beef2254f40","ja":"私もさっき、カメラさんから、「今日はセクシー路線も\n挑戦してみましょう」って言われて……。","zh":"我刚才也被摄影师说：“今天也挑战一下\n性感路线吧”……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"70d97fab7370e81fe92f3ac167572fd90c5ef96aa71801b8de5f56617a4edb2d","ja":"私にできるのかなって、\nすごく緊張してきちゃったんです……。","zh":"我一直在想自己到底能不能做好，\n不由得变得非常紧张……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6afca3f610fc83bc4828f99b4502a481cae1e1ea7f4235ba6ae3af35eb9d1541","ja":"そっか……まだ可奈ちゃんには早いわよね……。","zh":"这样啊……对可奈来说还太早了点呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c78d8739000826a694ece44c932fb89b216e04a55ad93eccc2e1e348f582dfe0","ja":"そうですよね……風花さんみたいに、\nセクシーだったらいいんですけど……。","zh":"也是呢……要是能像风花小姐那样\n性感就好了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3e7b7a6d351d92fc4374d840cafcf9f851e3b65f11726841f8ca96d0c2ae4a32","ja":"ええっ！　わ、私！？","zh":"诶！？　我、我吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b6c27474997741013113f6858d4d3b10fc74c2fc381679b8d71159615ece2ab1","ja":"はい！　風花さんみたいに大人っぽくなりたいな～♪\nなれるかな～♪　セクシーな可奈～♪","zh":"好！我也好想变得像风花小姐那样成熟呀～♪\n能做得到吗～♪性感的可奈～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"debb310d572d86e6c06bc4bfa8360169e2c1db0ed3fe69c0ab70306558d4ef88","ja":"……ふふ。ありがとう。\nちょっと、自信が出てきたかも。","zh":"……呵呵。谢谢。\n好像稍微有点自信了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a8eb9c3d605e8a89319ddd4ae03e8a2fb9ada4cadcbac8e29e2158fdb1685f1f","ja":"「それじゃあ、まずは矢吹さんから、\n撮影、よろしくお願いします！」","zh":"「那么，首先从矢吹小姐开始，\n拍摄就拜托你了！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"edd1c725212c9e2a018730909ac41aa7e1ca93b78b95e0333267b4f4bf0001c5","ja":"はーいっ！\nそれじゃあ、行ってきま～す！","zh":"好～的！\n那我走啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"659abbd83eebaf17e3619e9cc50b1e971221c039e3e3d3cd3ade38b2e16d13a1","ja":"頑張ってねっ！","zh":"要加油哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1618.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2da2851aff8ad7e21b04c2037d2df176352cc32fa1e695a6f23889110f46a1eb","ja":"（可奈ちゃんも不安になってるみたいだし……\n年上として、何かあったら私がフォローしなきゃ！）","zh":"（可奈好像也感到不安了……\n作为年长的一方，出了什么状况我得帮帮她才行！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
